    "Font Playground is free. If you find it useful, you can buy me a coffee to support its development. You won't see this message again, but Font Playground › Donate… is always there.": {
      "comment": "shell.donate.message",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Font Playground is free. If you find it useful, you can buy me a coffee to support its development. You won't see this message again, but Font Playground › Donate… is always there."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "字体混搭是免费的。如果它对你有用，可以请我喝杯咖啡，支持它的开发。这条消息不会再出现，但随时可以在“字体混搭” › “赞助…”中找到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Buy Me a Coffee": {
      "comment": "shell.donate.confirm",
